### 경매

### 회원가입
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "auction@test.com",
  "password": "1234",
  "nickname": "경매 판매자"
}

### 1. 로그인 (판매자)
### 로그인 → 토큰 복사
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "auction@test.com",
  "password": "1234"
}

### 1. 경매 등록 (판매자)
POST http://localhost:8080/auctions
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJhdWN0aW9uQHRlc3QuY29tIiwicm9sZSI6IlVTRVIiLCJpYXQiOjE3NzQyNjYyODIsImV4cCI6MTc3NDM1MjY4Mn0.djxRn3x3ypmRC7JCoYfCUL-tMMy8G0K5fL4ficatbP0
